1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:02,260
It rains GLASS here.

2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,370
Your umbrella?

3
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:04,233
Shredded.

4
00:00:04,310 --> 00:00:05,480
This whole sky is

5
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:06,790
one big...

6
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:08,300
GLASS factory.

7
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:09,380
The furnace?

8
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:10,450
Its star.

9
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:12,062
It's RIGHT there.

10
00:00:12,062 --> 00:00:13,655
Rock steams up...

11
00:00:13,655 --> 00:00:14,256
and comes down

12
00:00:14,256 --> 00:00:15,500
as glass.

13
00:00:15,537 --> 00:00:17,260
Then the wind hits.

14
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,600
Faster than a bullet.

15
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:20,609
So the glass falls...

16
00:00:20,609 --> 00:00:21,700
SIDEWAYS.

17
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:22,841
From space,

18
00:00:22,841 --> 00:00:23,612
scientists think

19
00:00:23,612 --> 00:00:25,418
all that glass makes it...

20
00:00:25,418 --> 00:00:26,310
BLUE.

21
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:27,133
Pretty, right?

22
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:28,680
It also stinks...

23
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:29,980
of rotten

24
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,100
EGGS.

25
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,330
Lovely planet.

26
00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:33,667
Pack an umbrella.

